{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22105","headline":"官舍小亭闲望 · 白居易","name":"官舍小亭闲望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风竹散清韵，烟槐凝绿姿。\n日高人吏去，闲坐在茅茨。\n葛衣御时暑，蔬饭疗朝饥。\n持此聊自足，心力少营爲。\n亭上独吟罢，眼前无事时。\n数峰太白雪，一卷陶潜诗。\n人心各自是，我是良在兹。\n回谢争名客，甘从君所嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}